/- English proof (translation)
Fix the arbitrary inputs or assume the hypotheses. Extract witnesses or component facts from the available result. Introduce a local definition for the expression. Rewrite the conclusion using the stated equalities. Separate the alternatives or extract the components of the hypothesis.

